由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-cookbook-extract-data (cookbook partial extract-data-ex03)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
var myObject = { user : "a", "user" : "b" }
output application/json
---
{ myObjectExample : myObject.user }
%%% output application/json
{
  "myObjectExample": "a"
}
